            <p>The gallery was too warm. The lighting was designed to make the art look brilliant while making everyone in the room look washed out. It was a modest group exhibition, mostly local commercial artists. Maya was wearing a dark blazer, standing near a display of her editorial pieces. Her face hurt from smiling.</p>
